litert: add GPU delegate diagnostic logging

Adds TF_LITE_KERNEL_LOG markers and diagnostics throughout the delegate
initialization and invoke paths so chromium --enable-logging reveals
what is happening:

- BuildFinalModel / GraphToGpuModel progress in delegate_kernel.cc;
- buffered error reporter message on invoke failure in compiled_model.cc;
- per-node GPU/CPU delegation split and ReplaceNodeSubsets result in
  delegate_webgpu.cc;
- BuildModel / ApplyGpuModelTransformations progress in model_builder.cc;
- per-opcode unsupported-node counts in model_builder.cc.

Pure logging; no behavioral change.

Merges former patches 10, 12, 14, 20, 21.

